# IndieFake Indian-accent dataset: raw drive-download zips, organized
# audio, and its degraded-augmentation copy are all large binary data --
# reproducible from the zips (kept in the user's Drive), not versioned.
# The eval manifests above (which files are held out / which generator
# they belong to) ARE versioned since those encode real methodology.
IndieFake  Dataset/
data_indian/
data_indian_augmented/
features_indian.npy

# Hindi/Tamil multilingual dataset: raw IndicTTS pulls + edge-tts
# synthesized fakes are large binary data, reproducible via
# scripts/extract_indictts_real.py and scripts/build_multilingual_fake.py
# -- not versioned, same rationale as data_indian/ above. transcripts.json
# IS worth keeping since it's small and pins exactly which sentences were
# used, but isn't tracked yet either -- add explicitly if wanted later.
data_hindi/
data_tamil/
features_hindi.npy
features_tamil.npy

*.egg-info/